      "countAsQuest:1": 1,
      "desc:8": "Every gun here uses the same three controls. Hold left click to fire (hold it down on automatic guns), press the Reload key (R by default) to put in fresh ammunition, and right-click to zoom on guns that have a scope. Rebind the keys under GregGuns in the Controls menu.\n\nThis quest wants any one of the early guns in your inventory: the Hand Cannon from the Steam chapter, or a 9mm Pistol, Revolver, Sawed Off or Bolt Action Rifle from LV. If you have not built one yet, pick a path and come back, or open the Steam chapter and craft the Hand Cannon first.\n\nReloading puts a short lockout on the gun, and each gun has its own reload time. Press Reload before the fight, not in the middle of it.\n\n[note]Hold a gun and read its tooltip: damage, clip size, the ammo it takes and its tier are all listed.[/note]",
